{'symbol': 'KEY', 'date': '2022-07-27 16:34:00', 'title': 'KEYCORP RAISES ITS PRIME LENDING RATE TO 5.5 PERCENT', 'text': "CLEVELAND , JULY 27, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- KEYCORP (NYSE: KEY) AND ITS BANKING AFFILIATES HAVE RAISED THEIR PRIME LENDING RATE TO 5.5 PERCENT FROM 4.75 PERCENT, EFFECTIVE TOMORROW, JULY 28, 2022. ABOUT KEYCORP KEYCORP'S ROOTS TRACE BACK NEARLY 200 YEARS TO ALBANY, NEW YORK."}